Z||000003||RossT||06-10-2000||11:08 PM||||The white minivan in the middle is mine, and its I can confirm that it is "not" a fiero conversion.<P>This picture shows no minivans and most of the 141 fieros that attended.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dellsrun1.JPG"> <P>This picture is V-8 Archies Fino.  Very nice from distance..<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dellsrun3.JPG"> <P>This is Chirs Moore's powerplant.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dellsrun2.JPG"> <P>My favorite..<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dellsrun5.JPG"> <P>and.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dellsrun4.JPG"> <P>It was a great time and the people from the Wisconsin Fiero Fanatics even arranged for 5.8 inches of rain on Thursday night so that we could all see if our sunroofs or t-tops leaked!!!!!<P>The show day was awesome!!!<P>Ross||||reg||1
